&lt;div style=&quot;background: #ffffff; padding: 10px; border: 2px solid #2F4F4F; width: 95%; margin: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://ja.scp-wiki.net/scp-1514-jp&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/author:soysoy-kusagawa/1514.png&quot; alt=&quot;1514.png&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;手复神躯&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-folded&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;SCP-1514-JP&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded&quot; style=&quot;display:none&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-unfolded-link&quot;&gt;&lt;a class=&quot;collapsible-block-link&quot; href=&quot;javascript:;&quot;&gt;为了用那手修复他者的御神体&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;collapsible-block-content&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1514-jp&quot;&gt;SCP-1514-JP&lt;/a&gt; - 破碎之身&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div style=&quot;text-align: left;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-block block-right&quot; style=&quot;width:200px;&quot;&gt;&lt;img src=&quot;http://ja.scp-wiki.net/local--files/scp-1514-jp/photo-1452987.jpg&quot; style=&quot;width:200px;&quot; alt=&quot;photo-1452987.jpg&quot; class=&quot;image&quot; /&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;scp-image-caption&quot; style=&quot;width:200px;&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://pixabay.com/ja/photo-1236578/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;The Broken Body&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p&gt;第五作。创作时间为一周又四天。&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: line-through;&quot;&gt;不是&lt;a href=&quot;https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%B0%81%E5%8D%B0%E3%81%95%E3%82%8C%E3%81%97%E3%82%A8%E3%82%AF%E3%82%BE%E3%83%87%E3%82%A3%E3%82%A2&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;艾克佐迪亚&lt;/a&gt;。&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;在SCP-INT了解到准GoI-KO「&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-int.wikidot.com/goi-index#toc3&quot;&gt;地下道教徒&lt;/a&gt;」的存在，以及1900年上半年存在的朝鲜半岛恐怖分子「&lt;a href=&quot;https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%A9%E7%83%88%E5%9B%A3&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;义烈团&lt;/a&gt;」的一员，有了「如果恐怖分子是匿名者，重武装，会不会很有趣」这样的想法。这是SCP-1514-JP的基础。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;之后，&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snoj&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3266034&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;snoj&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3266034)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snoj&quot;  &gt;snoj&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;翻译了中心页-CN「&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/hospital-hub&quot;&gt;医院&lt;/a&gt;」，&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/benjaminchong&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3699277&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;BenjaminChong&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3699277)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/benjaminchong&quot;  &gt;BenjaminChong&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;翻译了其关联Tale「&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/recovery-by-our-hands&quot;&gt;手复人躯&lt;/a&gt;」。“医院”这个中心的内容吸引了我，决定以“义烈团夺取医院的所有物进行恐怖活动的文档”为主题进行写作。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;当初是以义烈团为主的故事，在&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsukiyomizuku&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3344274&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;Tsukiyomizuku&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3344274)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsukiyomizuku&quot;  &gt;Tsukiyomizuku&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的指正下，让IJAMEA的职员登场，在采访记录中明确了义烈团、医院、IJAMEA之间的关系，并且在Twitter上接受了&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hasuma-s&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2767088&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;Hasuma_S&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2767088)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hasuma-s&quot;  &gt;Hasuma_S&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;的意见，经过对具体故事的反复调整，我投稿了第一篇JP医院报道文章。十分感谢两位。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SCP-CN方面广受欢迎，令我很印象深刻。以发起人&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aral-see&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3967270&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;Dr Aral See&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3967270)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/dr-aral-see&quot;  &gt;Dr Aral See&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;为首，收到了很多&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/forum/t-7293093/scp-1514-jp&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;表扬&lt;/a&gt;时的感动，至今还记得。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;特别感谢: 在网站内外进行草稿审查/批评的&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hasuma-s&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2767088&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;Hasuma_S&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2767088)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hasuma-s&quot;  &gt;Hasuma_S&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 、to2to2、&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsukiyomizuku&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3344274&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;Tsukiyomizuku&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3344274)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/tsukiyomizuku&quot;  &gt;Tsukiyomizuku&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 、&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3205804&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;yzkrt&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3205804)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt&quot;  &gt;yzkrt&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 借此机会表示感谢。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2018/09/01补记: &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mint-chocolate&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4106733&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;Mint chocolate&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4106733)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mint-chocolate&quot;  &gt;Mint chocolate&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 已将本文&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1514-jp&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;翻译&lt;/a&gt; 为SCP-CN！借此机会向其表示感谢。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;2020/01/10补记: &lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-phage&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2950095&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;Agent Phage&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2950095)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-phage&quot;  &gt;Agent Phage&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt; 在SCP-CN上&lt;a href=&quot;http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/project-aodake&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;写了&lt;/a&gt;一篇与本作品交叉链接的文章。（&lt;span class=&quot;printuser avatarhover&quot;&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snoj&quot;  &gt;&lt;img class=&quot;small&quot; src=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3266034&amp;amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;amp;timestamp=1606223613&quot; alt=&quot;snoj&quot; style=&quot;background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3266034)&quot; /&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/snoj&quot;  &gt;snoj&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/span&gt;已翻译为&lt;a href=&quot;http://ja.scp-wiki.net/project-aodake&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;日文&lt;/a&gt;！）！借此机会向其表示感谢。&lt;/p&gt;
